drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Bill Hart 14\:03':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,326.480\,329.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='比爾·哈特 14\:03':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,326.480\,329.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom, I\'m sorry to hear about the\nproblems with your apartment.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,329.448\,333.456)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='湯姆，得知你的公寓出現問題，我感到很遺憾。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,329.448\,333.456)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I was unaware of the leaking\nproblem. Don\'t worry though, your\nrental agreement states that the\ncosts of repairs are to be covered\nby the leaseholder (應為landlord).':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,333.856\,343.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我沒有意識到洩漏問題。不過不用擔心，您的租賃\n協議規定，維修費用將由承租人（應為房東）承擔\n。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,333.856\,343.480)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='As for the noise, the construction\nshould wrap up in three weeks.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,343.880\,348.272)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='至於噪音，施工將在三週內完成。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,343.880\,348.272)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom Bradley 14\:10':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,348.672\,351.336)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='湯姆·布拉德利 14\:10':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,348.672\,351.336)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Three weeks is still a very long\ntime. If possible, I\'d rather just\nend the agreement early and look\nfor a new apartment.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,351.736\,359.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='三個星期還是很長的時間。如果可以的話，我寧願\n早點終止協議，尋找新的公寓。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,351.736\,359.824)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Bill Hart 14\:16':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,360.224\,362.840)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='比爾·哈特 14\:16':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,360.224\,362.840)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I\'m sorry to hear that. If you\nwould really like to, we can end\nthe lease. But be aware that\nending the lease early forfeits\nyour deposit.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,363.240\,372.720)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='聽到這個消息我很遺憾。如果您確實願意，我們可\n以終止租約。但請注意，提前終止租約會沒收您的\n押金。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,363.240\,372.720)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='What issue is being discussed?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,373.120\,375.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='正在討論什麼問題？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,373.120\,375.664)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Renewing a rental lease for an\napartment.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,376.064\,379.064)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='續簽公寓的租賃合約。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,376.064\,379.064)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Problems a tenant has with an\napartment.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,379.464\,382.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='租戶對公寓的問題。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,379.464\,382.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Who should cover the cost of\ninstalling a bath.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,382.912\,386.176)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='誰應該承擔安裝浴缸的費用。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,382.912\,386.176)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='An unruly neighbor disturbing a\ntenant.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,386.576\,389.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='不守規矩的鄰居打擾了房客。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,386.576\,389.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='At 14\:16, what does Bill Hart mean\nwhen he says "But be aware that\nending the lease early forfeits\nyour deposit."?':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,390.024\,397.440)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='14\:16，比爾·哈特 (Bill\nHart)\n說“但請注意，提前終止租約將沒收您的押金”，這是什麼意思？':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,390.024\,397.440)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom will lose some money ending\nthe lease early.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,397.840\,401.056)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='提前結束租約湯姆會損失一些錢。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,397.840\,401.056)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom will need to deposit extra\nmoney to leave.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,401.456\,404.792)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='湯姆需要存額外的錢才能離開。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,401.456\,404.792)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom will have to give up any money\nhe won.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,405.192\,408.192)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='湯姆將不得不放棄他贏得的所有錢。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,405.192\,408.192)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Tom cannot end the lease agreement\nearly.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,408.592\,411.544)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='湯姆不能提前終止租約。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,408.592\,411.544)'